      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] Two cleanups in `emul_lsm6dso_append_raw_tag`:\n\n1. Make `emul_lsm6dso_append_raw_tag` `static` since it is only called within `zephyr/emul/emul_lsm6dso.c`.\n2. Remove the dead `fifo_pos +\u003d sizeof(uint16_t);` increment on **line 132** after writing `z`, as `fifo_pos` is not read again.\n\n```c\nstatic void emul_lsm6dso_append_raw_tag(const struct emul *emul,\n\t\t\t\t\tuint8_t raw_tag, int16_t x, int16_t y,\n\t\t\t\t\tint16_t z)\n{\n\tstruct lsm6dso_emul_data *data \u003d emul-\u003edata;\n\tint current_fifo_count \u003d emul_lsm6dso_get_fifo_count(emul);\n\tsize_t fifo_pos;\n\n\tif (current_fifo_count \u003e\u003d LSM6DSO_FIFO_MAX_SAMPLES) {\n\t\tLOG_ERR(\"FIFO full\");\n\t\treturn;\n\t}\n\n\tfifo_pos \u003d (data-\u003efifo_head +\n\t\t    (size_t)current_fifo_count * LSM6DSO_FIFO_SAMPLE_SIZE) %\n\t\t   sizeof(data-\u003efifo);\n\n\tdata-\u003efifo[fifo_pos++] \u003d raw_tag \u003c\u003c LSM6DSO_FIFO_TAG_SHIFT;\n\tsys_put_le16(x, \u0026data-\u003efifo[fifo_pos]);\n\tfifo_pos +\u003d sizeof(uint16_t);\n\tsys_put_le16(y, \u0026data-\u003efifo[fifo_pos]);\n\tfifo_pos +\u003d sizeof(uint16_t);\n\tsys_put_le16(z, \u0026data-\u003efifo[fifo_pos]);\n\n\temul_lsm6dso_set_fifo_count(emul, current_fifo_count + 1);\n}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/6004e2b7-5414-4dac-a398-e759d39999f4)",
